  "sourceTitle": "\"Ouroboros\", debugger-tracer for LLM and programmers, a tool that writes down what your program actually did: every call, its arguments and its result, in 8 languages",
  "sourceBodyHash": "d9124bc263bd08949b016f8617d2fe58254eb28710da12324b9ba78a375e29ae",
